  "L6 (statistical): Spearman t/df=2 approximation invalid at n=4 (reports p~0 at |rho|=1; exact two-sided permutation floor is 2/24=0.083, so the trend leg alone can never reach p<0.05 at n=4). Replaced with exact permutation p; disclosed in advance that the drift leg decides.",
